**Potential coalitions:**

[? if linke_b >= 45 : Left majority government: [+ linke_b +]% ?]

[? if (linke_b + greens_b + spd_b) >= 40 : Red-red-green coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>): [+ (linke_b + spd_b + greens_b) +]% ?]

[? if ampelkoalition_failed = 0 and (spd_b + greens_b + fdp_b) >= 40 : Traffic Light Coalition (<span style="color: #c00000;">**SPD**</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">**KPD**</span>): [+ (spd_b + greens_b + fdp_b) +]% ?]

[? if (linke_b + bsw_b) >= 40 : Purple coalition (linke+bsw): [+ (linke_b + bsw_b) +]% ?]

[? if (spd_b + cdu_b) >= 40 and ampelkoalition_failed : Grand Coalition(cdu/csu+spd): [+ (spd_b + cdu_b) +]% ?]

[? if (spd_b + greens_b + cdu_b) >= 40 and ampelkoalition_failed and (spd_b + cdu_b) < 45 : Kenyan coalition(cdu/csu+spd+greens): [+ (cdu_b + spd_b + greens_b) +]% ?]

[? if brandmauer = 0 and (cdu_b + afd_b) >= 40 : Midnight coalition(afd+cdu/csu): [+ (afd_b + cdu_b) +]% ?]

[? if brandmauer = 0 and (cdu_b + afd_b) < 45 and (cdu_b + afd_b + fdp_b) >= 45 : Jamaican coalition(afd+cdu/csu+fdp): [+ (afd_b + cdu_b + fdp_b) +]% ?]

There are some potential coalition arrangements.

@achievement_check_e
on-arrival: stabile_demokratie = 1 if center_right_coalition >= 50 and weimar_coalition >= 50 and dnvp_ideology == "Moderate"
go-to: stabile_demokratie if stabile_demokratie; coalition_menu if not stabile_demokratie

@stabile_demokratie
achievement: stabile_demokratie
go-to: coalition_menu

@coalition_menu

- @do_linke_majority
- @do_linke_bsw
- @rrgreen_coalition_do
- @do_ampelkoalition
- @do_kenya
- @do_groko
- @do_jamaica
- @do_midnight
- @no_majority

@do_linke_majority
title: text linke maj
view-if: linke_majority >= 50
on-arrival: linke_in_government = 1; in_linke_majority = 1

@do_linke_bsw
title: text linbsw
view-if: linke_bsw_coalition >= 50
choose-if: bsw_relation >= 60
on-arrival: bsw_in_government = 1; linke_in_government = 1; in_linke_bsw_coalition = 1
go-to: ministries

@rrgreen_coalition_do
title: text r2g
view-if: (rrgreen_coalition >= 50)
choose-if: (greens_relation >= 60 and spd_relation >= 60)
on-arrival: linke_in_government = 1; greens_in_government = 1; spd_in_government = 1; in_rrgreen_coalition = 1
go-to: ministries

@do_ampelkoalition
title: text ampel
view-if: (ampelkoalition_coalition >= 50 and ampelkoalition_failed = 0)
on-arrival: fdp_in_government = 1; spd_in_government = 1; greens_in_government = 1; ampelkoalition = 1

@do_kenya
title: text kenya
view-if: (kenya_coalition_combo >= 50 and ampelkoalition_failed and groko_combo < 50)
choose-if: brandmauer
on-arrival: cdu_in_government = 1; spd_in_government = 1; greens_in_government = 1; kenya_coalition = 1

@do_groko
title: text_groko
view-if: (groko_combo >= 50)
choose-if: brandmauer or midnight_combo < 50
on-arrival: cdu_in_government = 1; spd_in_government = 1; groko = 1

@do_midnight
title: text midnight
view-if: (brandmauer = 0 and midnight_coalition_combo >= 50)
on-arrival: cdu_in_government = 1; afd_in_government = 1; midnight_coalition = 1

@do_jamaica
title: text jamaica
view-if: (brandmauer = 0 and midnight_coalition_combo < 50 and jamaica_coalition_combo >= 50)
on-arrival: cdu_in_government = 1; afd_in_government = 1; fdp_in_government = 1; jamaica_coalition = 1

@no_majority
title: There is no clear governing majority.
view-if: (((weimar_coalition < 50 or weimar_coalition_failed == 1 or ddp_relation < 30 or z_relation < 30 or lvp_relation < 30) and (grand_coalition < 50 or grand_coalition_failed == 1) or (grand_coalition >= 50 and ((dvp_ideology == "Right" and black_thursday_seen == 1) or not dvp_exist)) and far_right_coalition < 50 and ((right_coalition < 50) or (right_coalition >= 50 and dnvp_ideology == "Radical") and center_right_coalition < 50 or (center_right_coalition >= 50 and ((dnvp_ideology == "Radical") or (year = 1929 and month >= 7))))) or rubicon or cvp_formed) and dnef_r < 50 and president == "Hindenburg"
on-arrival: no_majority_elections += 1
go-to: new_elections
# either new elections, or Hindenburg appoints either Brüning, Papen, Schleicher, or Hitler.


@new_elections
go-to: new_elections_2

@new_elections_2
on-arrival: {!
Q.next_election_month = Q.month + 3;
Q.next_election_time = Q.time + 3;
if (Q.next_election_month > 12) {
    Q.next_election_month -= 12;
    Q.next_election_year = Q.year + 1;
} else {
    Q.next_election_year = Q.year;
}
!}

There is no path to a workable Reichstag majority or minority government. The next elections are set for [+ next_election_month : month +] [+ next_election_year +].

The people's faith in democracy is shaken by this ordeal. Of course, the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Nazis</span> are exploiting the instability to claim that democracy is unworkable, and that Germany needs a strong leader.



